stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: build separate hierarchy
    Created --> Validating: map request
    Validating --> Rejected: not canonical, misaligned,<br/>duplicate, or writable + executable
    Rejected --> Created: nothing changed
    Validating --> Building: request is valid
    Building --> Mapped: all levels allocated and linked
    Building --> RolledBack: allocation fails part way
    RolledBack --> Created: only owned pages recycled
    Mapped --> Unmapping: unmap request
    Unmapping --> Created: owned table pages recycled safely
    Mapped --> NotYetActive: loading CR3 with this hierarchy
    NotYetActive --> [*]: planned, not done
    note right of NotYetActive
        Hierarchy stays inactive.
        No CPU access through it
        and no hardware NX fault
        has been demonstrated yet.
    end note
